draw(A--B--C--D--cycle);
draw(A--C);
label("$12$", A--B, S);
label("$5$", B--C,E);
label("$13$", A--C, NW);
draw(rightanglemark(A,B,C,15));
[/asy]

Let the 12-gon be $ABCDEFGHIJKL,$ and let $O$ be the center, so $OA = 12.$

